{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"6a2e64eb-1e25-4697-89d3-84d4b7a32a28","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented a fix for the 500 error that occurs on the second publish.\n\n**Key changes**\n- Added `from decimal import Decimal` import.\n- Updated `related` to convert similarity scores to `Decimal` before storing them, preventing DynamoDB (and the test `FakeTable`) from rejecting float values.\n- Cleaned up duplicate imports.\n\nThe cause and detailed fix are documented in **[ANSWER.md](/Users/valentinakoniukhava/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/6a2e64eb-1e25-4697-89d3-84d4b7a32a28/ANSWER.md)**.\n","duration_seconds":49.370142,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":16806,"output_tokens":3536,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":141120,"total_tokens":20342}}}
